{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "\u653b\u57ce\u4e0e\u53ec\u5524 Siege and Summons \u30105\u5206\u949f\u4e00\u5c40 \u7b56\u7565\u7ade\u6280 \u3011",
    "steam_appid": 2888980,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888980/extras/eacd4535e78dd1800273065c635d2384.poster.avif?t=1732699549\" width=548 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888980/extras/eacd4535e78dd1800273065c635d2384.webm?t=1732699549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Siege and Summon is an online turn-based competitive card game set in the Three Kingdoms era. Players can use soldier cards and skill cards to build a deck of cards to challenge powerful players in the world of the Three Kingdoms. NPCs can also fight against other players and form teams to challenge dungeons.<br><br>Game features<br>\u25c6 Card deck: Players can use soldier cards and skill cards to build their own deck for battle. Soldier cards are divided into: ordinary, elite, and hero. Two ordinary cards can be put into battle; other cards can be put into battle one. The deck can contain up to 30 cards, which can include soldier cards and skill cards.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888980/extras/2f5759f8dad21e514706fb85cc971e0d.avif?t=1732699549\" width=550 height=292 /></span><br>\u25c6How to play: Players use their respective decks to fight on a 3*10 field. The enemy and we take turns taking action until the opponent's general or our general is defeated.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888980/extras/4137d62a31a351b216c841b159dd9138.avif?t=1732699549\" width=550 height=311 /></span><br>\u25c6 Profession: Players can freely choose among 4 professions: Swordsman, Dharma Lord, Taoist Saint, and Divine Arrow; each deck can only use the same profession card.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888980/extras/9b98e4b1f61e48bdf249cd9b0f07b86f.avif?t=1732699549\" width=550 height=225 /></span><br>\u25c6 Push pictures: After building a deck, players can engage in push battles to fight against NPC decks with their own characteristics; push pictures to obtain protagonist experience, copper coins and various treasure chests; and only push pictures can obtain advanced professional cards.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888980/extras/8f3cf22e92e233a26251eae54fa4692e.avif?t=1732699549\" width=550 height=360 /></span><br>\u25c6Competition: After the arena is opened, you can compete with other players, and it is endless fun to fight with others; the arena is settled quarterly, and each quarter is based on the player's points ranking. The top players can get the soldier card that will be launched next season.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888980/extras/4d1ab811dc666fd767252ed30aae6dee.avif?t=1732699549\" width=550 height=230 /></span><br>\u25c6 Team formation: After the team dungeon is opened, you can form a team with other players to challenge high-difficulty dungeons; the dungeons are divided into three difficulty levels: simple, normal, and difficult. The higher the difficulty, the greater the benefits.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888980/extras/c0904665f69d649498c5e690cd195463.avif?t=1732699549\" width=550 height=311 /></span>",
